est embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Mtindo mpya zaidi wa uwekaji kutoka kwa mtoa huduma wa kwanza aliyeunganishwa —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Kubadilisha hiki kunaunda upya faharasa ya utafutaji ya kila programu-jalizi inayokitumia.','best quality'=>'ubora bora','lowest cost'=>'gharama ya chini kabisa','fastest'=>'haraka zaidi','Add a model yourself'=>'Ongeza modeli mwenyewe','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Je, modeli imetoka leo? Bandika jina lake kamili ili uitumie mara moja.','Model name'=>'Jina la mtindo','Add model'=>'Ongeza modeli','Recommended models list'=>'Orodha ya mif modelo iliyopendekezwa','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Orodha ya miundo inayopendekezwa haikuweza kuthibitishwa, kwa hiyo hakuna mapendekezo yanayoonyeshwa. Sakinisha tena programu-jalizi, au uwashe sasisho za kila siku hapa chini.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Orodha inayotumika ilichapishwa mnamo %s. Kila sasisho la programu-jalizi huleta mpya.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Pia angalia Zinn Digital® mara moja kwa siku kwa orodha iliyosasishwa.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ombi la upakuaji wa kawaida tu ndilo linalotumikaje: hakuna ufunguo, hakuna anwani ya tovuti, hakuna kitu kuhusu maudhui yako. Orodha hiyo imesainiwa, na orodha ambayo inashindwa ukaguzi wa sahihi hupuuzwa.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Ilichunguzwa mwisho %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Hifadhi, kisha uangalie sasa ikiwa imewashwa','a newer list was installed'=>'orododha mpya zaidi imewekwa','already up to date'=>'tayari imesasishwa','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'upakuaji umeshindwa ukaguzi wa sahihi na umepuuzwa','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuwezi kufikiwa; orodha ya sasa inabaki ikitumika','turned off'=>'imezimwa','Open'=>'Fungua','Check their status page'=>'Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali','Open your billing page'=>'Fungua ukurasa wako wa malipo','Open your API keys page'=>'Fungua ukurasa wako wa funguo za API','Open the AI settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio ya AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Samahani, huruhusiwi kufanya hivyo.','Unknown provider.'=>'Mtoa huduma hajulikani.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Weka anwani ya huduma yako, kwa mfano http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Hiyo haionekani kama ufunguo wa API. Nakili tena, bila nafasi.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Bandika ufunguo wako wa API kwanza.','Key removed.'=>'Ufunguo umeondolewa.','Models saved.'=>'Modeli zimehifadhiwa.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Weka jina halisi la mfano, kwa mfano kama nyaraka za mtoa huduma zinavyoandika.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'Imeongezwa %s. Ichague chini ya "Which model to use".','Model removed.'=>'Kielelezo kimeondolewa.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Sasisho za kila siku zimezimwa. Orodha iliyokuja na programu-jalizi inatumika.','Checked: %s.'=>'Imetezwa: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Orodha za miundo zimesasishwa.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI umehifadhiwa na toleo jipya zaidi la moja ya programu-jalizi zako. Sasisha programu-jalizi hii, au uweke ufunguo tena katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI uliohifadhiwa hauwezi kufunguliwa tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zimebadilika). Ingiza tena katika mipangilio ya AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI bado haijasakinishwa. Ongeza ufunguo wa mtoa huduma wa AI katika mipangilio ya AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna mfano uliochaguliwa kwa kazi hii. Chagua mmoja katika mipangilio ya AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyo wa AI hautumiki na toleo hili la programu-jalizi.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna mtoa huduma wa AI anayeweza kutengeneza picha ambaye ameunganishwa. Ongeza ufunguo wa OpenAI au Google Gemini katika mipangilio ya AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyu wa AI hawezi kutengeneza picha. Chagua OpenAI au Google Gemini kwa ajili ya picha katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI hauwezi kutumia mtindo wowote wa picha. Angalia ruhusa za ufunguo huo kwa mtoa huduma, au chagua mtoa huduma mwingine kwa ajili ya picha.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna mtoa huduma wa AI aliyeounganishwa anayeweza kuunda faharasa ya utafutaji. Ongeza ufunguo wa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral au OpenRouter katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI hauwezi kutumia mtindo wowote wa upachikaji. Angalia ruhusa za ufunguo huo na mtoa huduma, au chagua mtoa huduma mwingine kwa ajili ya utafutaji wa tovuti.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyu wa AI hawezi kujenga faharasa ya utafutaji. Unganisha Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral au huduma inayooana kwa ajili ya utafutaji wa tovuti.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kufikia huduma yako ya AI. Hakikisha kuwa inafanya kazi na kwamba anwani yake inawezekana kufikiwa kutoka kwa seva yako ya wavuti (huduma iliyo kwenye kompyuta yako mwenyewe haiwezi kufikiwa kutoka kwa tovuti inayopangishwa).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kufikia %s. Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali; ikiwa iko hewani, mwenyeji wako anaweza kuwa anazuia miunganisho ya kutoa, au anwani si sahihi.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s inasema akaunti yako haina salio au mgao uliobaki. Ongeza salio au ongeza kikomo chako katika akaunti yako nao, kisha jaribu tena.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s haikubali ufunguo wako. Huenda ukaingizwa vibaya, umefutwa au muda wake umekwisha. Unda ufunguo mpya na ubandike hapa.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s alikataa ombi hili kwa ufunguo wako. Ufunguo unaweza usiwe na ufikiaji wa mtindo au kipengele hiki, au akaunti yako inahitaji kuthibitishwa.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Mfano wa "%1$s" haupatikani kutoka kwa %2$s kwa ajili ya ufunguo wako. Chagua mfano mwingine katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Mpango wako wa %2$s haujumuishi modeli ya "%1$s". Chagua modeli nyingine katika mipangilio ya AI, au boresha mpango wako nao.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s inaweka kiwango cha juu cha jinsi kitufe chako kinavyoweza kutuma maombi kwa kasi gani. Subiri dakika moja kisha ujaribu tena, au ongeza kiwango chako cha kikomo cha matumizi nao.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s inapata shida kwa sasa (kutapakaa au mzigo mkubwa upande wao). Hakuna tatizo na mipangilio yako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ombi la AI limeshindwa kwa sababu ambayo hatukuweza kuitambua. Jaribu tena; likiendelea kutokea, wasiliana na usaidizi ukitumia maelezo yaliyo hapa chini.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mtoa huduma wa AI amejibu kwa mfumo ambao programu-jalishi hii haikuweza kusoma. Jaribu tena; ikiwa itaendelea kutokea, chagua mtindo mwingine au wasiliana na huduma kwa wateja.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Maalum (Inayooana na OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Hifadhi ufunguo wa mtoa huduma huyu kwanza.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Ufunguo wako unafanya kazi, lakini mtoa huduma haorodheti mtindo wowote wa maandishi kwa ajili yake. Ongeza mtindo wewe mwenyewe hapa chini.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Imeunganishwa. %1$s alijibu kwa kutumia %2$s. Vipengele vyako vya AI viko tayari kutumika.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Jukumu lako la mtumiaji haliruhusiwi kutumia AI kwenye tovuti hii. Muulize msimamizi.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Tovuti hii imefikia kikomo chake cha matumizi ya AI ya kila mwezi. Msimamizi anaweza kukiinua katika mipangilio ya AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Tovuti hii imefikia kikomo chake cha kila mwezi cha maombi ya AI. Msimamizi anaweza kukiongeza katika mipangilio ya AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Matumizi na gharama','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Kumbukumbu, vikomo na ruhusa za nafasi hutumika kwa AI inayotumiwa kupitia: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Gharama ni za makadirio, zilizokokotwo kutoka kwa bei zilizochapishwa; modeli isiyo na bei inayojulikana inahesabiwa kama sufuri.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Mwezi huu: maombi %1$s, takriban %2$s.','When'=>'Wakati','Who'=>'Nani','Used for'=>'Inayotumika kwa','Model'=>'Mfano','Tokens in / out'=>'Tokeni zinazoingia / zinazotoka','About'=>'Kuhusu','Result'=>'Matokeo','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Hakuna maombi ya AI yaliyofanywa bado.','Done'=>'Imekamilika','Limits and permissions'=>'Vikomo na ruhusa','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Kiwango cha juu cha matumizi ya kila mwezi (dola za US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Acha wazi kukiwa hakuna kikomo. AI husimama kwa mwezi uliosalia mara tu gharama inayokadiriwa inapofikia kiwango hicho.','Monthly request limit'=>'Kikomo cha maombi ya kila mwezi','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Acha tupu kwa kikomo chochote.','Who may use AI'=>'Nani anayeweza kutumia AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Weka alama yoyote ili kuruhusu kila mtu anayeweza kutumia vipengele vya programu-jalizi kutumia AI. Wasimamizi wanaweza kuitumia kila wakati.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Hifadhi vigezo na ruhusa','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Vikomo na ruhusa vimehifadhiwa.','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'Lugha hiyo si mojawapo ya lugha za tovuti hii.','A translation must be the same kind of content as the original.'=>'Tafsiri lazima iwe ya aina sawa ya maudhui kama asili.','Choose one of the site\'s other languages.'=>'Chagua mojawapo ya lugha nyingine za tovuti.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Hati za mfumo za skrini ya msimamizi hazipo kwenye nakala hii ya programu-jalizi. Isakinishe upya kutoka kwenye kifurushi kilichotolewa.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Skrini hii inahitaji JavaScript.','Choose a language'=>'Chagua lugha','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Wateja wa hosting? Pata punguzo la %1$d%% kwenye %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Kama mteja wa uenyeji wa Zinn Digital®, unapata msimbo wa kibinafsi wa punguzo la %d%% kwa malipo yako ya kwanza. Upyaji ni kwa bei ya kawaida.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Pata nambari yangu ya %d%% kisha uende kwenye malipo','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Punguzo hili ni kwa ajili ya wateja walio na mpango wa mwenyeji unaolipishwa ulio katika hali nzuri. Majaribio ya bure hayastahili.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Tayari umeshatumia punguzo lako la mteja wa uenyeji kwa plagi hii.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Hatukuweza kupata msimbo wako kwa sasa. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Kiambishi awali lazima kiwe na herufi 1 hadi 8 za mwanzoni ndogo au nambari, kianze na herufi, na kisiwe jina la plagi.','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" si msimbo wa lugha. Tumia eneo la WordPress kama vile fr_FR au de_DE.','List at least one language.'=>'Orodhesha angalau lugha moja.','Translations'=>'Tafsiri','Edit the %s version'=>'Hariri toleo la %s','Compare the %s version side by side'=>'Linganisha toleo la %s upande kwa upande','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','Alternative text'=>'Maandishi mbadala','Caption'=>'Maelezo mafupi','Title'=>'Kichwa cha habari','Choose one of your menus for each language.'=>'Chagua mojawapo ya menyu zako kwa kila lugha.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to protect.'=>'Hii si tafsiri, kwa hiyo hakuna cha kulinda.','This kind of content is not translated.'=>'Aina hii ya maudhui haijatafsiriwa.','Text %s is not on this site any more. Reload the page.'=>'Maandishi %s hayako kwenye tovuti hii tena. Pakia upya ukurasa.','No translation engine could take this text.'=>'Hakuna injini ya tafsiri inayoweza kuchukua maandishi haya.','Choose one of your other languages.'=>'Chagua mojawapo ya lugha zako zingine.','Compare translation'=>'Linganisha tafsiri','You are not allowed to edit this translation.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuhariri tafsiri hii.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to compare.'=>'Hii si tafsiri, kwa hiyo hakuna cha kulinganisha.','The original of this translation no longer exists.'=>'Nakala ya asili ya tafsiri hii haipo tena.','Piece %s is not part of this translation any more. Reload the page and try again.'=>'Kipande %s si sehemu ya tafsiri hii tena. Pakia upya ukurasa na ujaribu tena.','This one'=>'Hii moja','Translate again'=>'Tafsiri tena','Translate'=>'Tafsiri','Create a copy to translate by hand'=>'Tengeneza nakala ya kutafsiri kwa mkono','Translate uses the engine set for that language. A version a person edited is never overwritten.'=>'Tafsiri hutumia injini iliyowekwa kwa lugha hiyo. Toleo lililohaririwa na mtu haliwahi kuandikwa juu yake.','You are not allowed to translate this item.'=>'Huruhusiwa kutafsiri kipengele hiki.','%s: translated.'=>'%s: imetafsiriwa.','Translate on this page'=>'Tafsiri kwenye ukurasa huu','This item already has a version in that language.'=>'Kipengele hiki tayari kina toleo katika lugha hiyo.','That translation engine is not available on this site.'=>'Injini hiyo ya kutafsiri haipatikani kwenye tovuti hii.','Different engines per language, automatic fallback and spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Injini tofauti kwa kila lugha, urejeshaji otomatiki na vikomo vya matumizi ni vipengele vya Tranzly Pro.','Each language must be one of the site\'s languages, with an available engine.'=>'Kila lugha lazima iwe mojawapo ya lugha za tovuti, ikiwa na injini inayopatikana.','The fallback list may only name available engines.'=>'Orodha mbadala inaweza kutaja injini zinazopatikana pekee.','A monthly cap is an amount in US dollars, zero or more, for an available engine.'=>'Kikomo cha kila mwezi ni kiasi katika dola za US, sifuri au zaidi, kwa injini inayopatikana.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features. The do-not-translate list is free.'=>'Tafsiri zinazopendwa na mtindo kwa kila lugha ni vipengele vya Tranzly Pro. Orodha ya kutotafsiri ni ya bure.','Glossary entries must be grouped by one of the site\'s languages.'=>'Ingizo za kamusi lazima zipangwa kwa lugha mojawapo ya tovuti.','Tone is set per site language: formality default, more or less, plus optional instructions.'=>'Sauti huwekwa kwa kila lugha ya tovuti: kiasi cha rasmi kwa chaguo-msingi, zaidi au chini, pamoja na maagizo ya hiari.','The value for %s is not one of the allowed choices.'=>'Thamani ya %s si mojawapo ya chaguo zinazoruhusiwa.','The background queue is not available on this site.'=>'Foleni ya nyuma haipatikani kwenye tovuti hii.','A translation job runs as the person who starts it, so a user must be signed in.'=>'Kazi ya tafsiri huendeshwa kama mtu anayeianzisha, kwa hivyo mtumiaji lazima awe ameingia kwenye akaunti.','There is nothing you are allowed to translate in that selection.'=>'Hakuna chochote unachoruhusiwa kutafsiri katika uteuzi huo.','That item is not part of a translation job.'=>'Bidhaa hiyo si sehemu ya kazi ya utafsiri.','You are not allowed to change that translation.'=>'Huruhusiwi kubadilisha tafsiri hiyo.','This item\'s group already has a %1$s version (#%2$d).'=>'Kikundi cha bidhaa hii tayari kina toleo la %1$s (#%2$d).','An item cannot be its own translation.'=>'Bidhaa haiwezi kuwa tafsiri yake yenyewe.','That item is already a translation of something else. Unlink it first.'=>'Bidhaa hiyo tayari ni tafsiri ya kitu kingine. Kitenganishe kwanza.','The translation link could not be saved.'=>'Kiungo cha tafsiri kimeshindwa kuhifadhiwa.','That text cannot be translated here.'=>'Maandishi hayo hayawezi kutafsiriwa hapa.','That media text cannot be translated here.'=>'Maandishi hayo ya media hayawezi kutafsiriwa hapa.','A translation can be published or kept as a draft.'=>'Tafsiri inaweza kuchapishwa au kuwekwa kama rasimu.','You are not allowed to publish this kind of content.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuchapisha aina hii ya maudhui.','This item is already written in that language.'=>'Kipengele hiki kimeshaandikwa katika lugha hiyo.','This translation was edited by a person (or imported), so it is protected. Unlock it to translate it again.'=>'Tafsiri hii ilihaririwa na mtu (au kuingizwa kutoka nje), kwa hiyo imelindwa. Ifungue ili uweze kuitafsiri tena.','That item does not exist.'=>'Bidhaa hiyo haipo.','No translation engine is set up yet. Add a key for one in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'Hakuna injini ya tafsiri iliyowekwa bado. Ongeza ufunguo wa moja katika Tranzly → Engines.','That translation engine is not set up yet: add its key first.'=>'Injini hiyo ya tafsiri haijasakinishwa bado: ongeza ufunguo wake kwanza.','The same text is being translated by another job right now; this item will use that answer.'=>'Maandishi hayo yanatafsiriwa na kazi nyingine kwa sasa; bidhaa hii itatumia jibu hilo.','No translation engine could take this item.'=>'Hakuna injini ya tafsiri inayoweza kuchukua kipengele hiki.','The engine did not return a translation for every part of this item. Nothing was changed.'=>'Injini haikurudisha tafsiri kwa kila sehemu ya kipengele hiki. Hakuna kilichobadilishwa.','AI model'=>'Mtindo wa AI','AI model (%1$s %2$s)'=>'Mfano wa AI (%1$s %2$s)','%s is having problems right now. Try again shortly, or use another engine.'=>'%s inapata shida kwa sasa. Jaribu tena hivi punde, au tumia injini nyingine.','Your site could not reach %s. Check that it can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Tovuti yako haikuweza kufikia %s. Hakikisha kuwa inaweza kufanya miunganisho ya kutoa data, kisha jaribu tena.','%s did not accept your API key. Check the key in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'%s haikukubali ufunguo wako wa API. Angalia ufunguo katika Tranzly → Engines.','Your %s account has used up its quota or balance. Top it up with them, or use another engine.'=>'Akaunti yako ya %s imemaliza kiwango au salio lake. Iongezee salio, au tumia injini nyingine.','%s asked us to slow down. It will be tried again automatically.'=>'%s alituomba tupunguze kasi. Jaribio litafanywa tena kiotomatiki.','This text is too long for %s in one go. Split the content, or use another engine.'=>'Maandishi haya ni marefu sana kwa %s kwa mara moja. Gawanya maudhui, au tumia injini nyingine.','%s refused to translate this content. Try another engine, or translate it by hand.'=>'%s imekataa kutafsiri maudhui haya. Jaribu injini nyingine, au itafsiri kwa mkono.','%s does not translate this language. Choose another engine for it.'=>'%s haitafsiri lugha hii. Chagua injini nyingine kwa ajili yake.','This month\'s spending cap for %s is reached, so nothing more was sent to it. Raise the cap in Tranzly → Engines, or wait until next month.'=>'Kikomo cha matumizi cha mwezi huu kwa ajili ya %s kimefikiwa, kwa hiyo hakuna kingine kilichotumwa huko. Ongeza kikomo katika Tranzly → Engines, au subiri hadi mwezi ujao.','The translation with %s failed for a reason Tranzly could not identify. The details are below.'=>'Tafsiri yenye %s imeshindwa kwa sababu ambayo Tranzly haikuweza kutambua. Maelezo yako hapa chini.','An engine id must be lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Kitambulisho cha injini lazima kiwe na herufi ndogo, nambari na vapa.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'ufunguo wa leseni','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Mtumiaji bado hajahusishwa na leseni, jambo ambalo ni muhimu ili kuzuia uanzishaji usioidhinishwa. Ili kumkabidhi mtumiaji wako leseni hiyo, unakubali kushiriki jina kamili na anwani ya barua pepe ya mtumiaji wako wa WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'tovuti zilizotajwa hapo juu','Account'=>'Akaunti','Account Details'=>'Maelezo ya Akaunti','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Akaunti inasubiri kuwezeshwa. Tafadhali angalia barua pepe yako na ubofye kiungo ili kuwezesha akaunti yako kisha utume tena fomu ya ushirika.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ungependa kuunganisha %1$s katika %2$s?','Actions'=>'Vitendo','Activate'=>'Washa','Activate Free Version'=>'Washa Toleo la Bure','Activate License'=>'Washa Leseni','activate a license here'=>'weka leseni hapa','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Tafadhali weka ufunguo wa leseni uliopokea kupitia barua pepe mara tu