o.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'Jaribio la bure la %s limeghairiwa kwa mafanikio. Kwa kuwa programu-jalizi hii ni ya kulipia pekee, imezimwa kiotomatiki. Ikiwa ungependa kuitumia siku za usoni, utahitaji kununua leseni.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s haiwezi kuendesha bila programu-jalizi.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s haiwezi kufanya kazi bila %2$s.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Ninakujulisha tu kwamba maelezo ya viongezeo vya %s yanavukwa kutoka kwenye seva ya nje.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Visingi vya moduli %s','Address Line %d'=>'Mstari wa Anwani %d','Affiliate'=>'Mshirika','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Kutokana na kukiuka sheria zetu za ushirika, tumeamua kusimamisha kwa muda akaunti yako ya ushirika. Ikiwa una maswali yoyote, tafadhali wasiliana na huduma kwa wateja.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Akaunti yako ya ushirika imesimamishwa kwa muda.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'Maombi yako ya ushirika kwa ajili ya %1$s yamekubaliwa! Ingia katika eneo lako la ushirika kupitia: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Asante kwa kuomba kujiunga na programu yetu ya washirika, kwa bahati mbaya, tumeamua kwa sasa kukataa ombi lako. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya siku 30.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Asan