 you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'Barua pepe ya uthibitisho imetumwa tu kwa %s. Lazima uthibitishe sasisho hili ndani ya saa 4 zijazo. Ikiwa huwezi kupata barua pepe hiyo, tafadhali angalia folda yako ya taka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Barua pepe ya uthibitisho imetumwa tu kwa %s. Mmiliki wa barua pepe lazima athibitishe sasisho hilo ndani ya saa 4 zijazo.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s ndiye mmiliki mpya wa akaunti.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Asante kwa kuthibitisha mabadiliko ya umiliki. Barua pepe imetumwa tu kwa %s kwa ajili ya idhinisho la mwisho.','Change Ownership'=>'Badilisha Umiliki','Change Plan'=>'Badilisha Mpango','Change User'=>'Badilisha Mtumiaji','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Kwa kubadilisha mtumiaji, unakubali kuhamisha umiliki wa akaunti kwenda kwa:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Orodha ya Mabadiliko','Changing user, please wait'=>'Inabadilisha mtumiaji, tafadhali subiri','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Kama hukupokea barua pepe hiyo, jaribu kuangalia folda yako ya taka au utafute barua pepe kutoka kwa %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Lipa','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Chagua tovuti hadi %s za kuamilisha leseni.','City'=>'Jiji','Clear API Cache'=>'Futa Akiba ya API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Futa Vipindi Vya Sasisho Vinavyopita','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Bonyeza hapa','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Bonyeza hapa kutumia programu-jalizi hii bila kutaja jina lako','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Bonyeza ili uone maoni yaliyotoa ukadiriaji wa %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s ndiyo anwani ya barua pepe ya mteja wangu','Code'=>'Msimbo','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Tume %s wakati mteja anaponunua leseni mpya.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Kwa kuwa tunatenga siku 30 kwa ajili ya uwezekano wa kurejeshewa fedha, tunalipa tu kamisheni ambazo ni za zaidi ya siku 30.','Communication'=>'Mawasiliano','Compatible up to'=>'Inatumika hadi','complete the opt-in'=>'kamilisha kujisajili','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Hongera','Never miss an important update'=>'Usikose kamwe sasisho muhimu','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Asante kwa kusasisha hadi %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Jiandikishe ili upate arifa za barua pepe kwa ajili ya usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, maudhui ya elimu, na matoleo ya mara kwa mara, na ili ushiriki maelezo ya msingi ya mazingira ya WordPress. Hii itatusaidia kufanya %s iendane zaidi na tovuti yako na iwe bora zaidi katika kufanya kile unachohitaji ifanye.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Jisajili ili upate arifa za barua pepe kwa ajili ya usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, maudhui ya kielimu, na matoleo ya hapa na pale, na ili kushiriki baadhi ya maelezo ya msingi ya mazingira ya WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Ukiruka hili, hakuna nishida! %1$s bado itafanya kazi vizuri tu.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Tumeleta chaguo hili ili usipate kukosa sasisho muhimu na kutusaidia kufanya %s iendane vyema na tovuti yako na iwe bora zaidi katika kufanya kile unachohitaji ifanye.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Tuna furaha kuanzisha ujumuishaji wa kiwango cha mtandao wa Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Wakati wa mchakato wa kusasisha, tumetambua tovuti %s kwenye mtandao ambazo bado zinahitaji umakini wako.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Wakati wa mchakato wa kusasisha, tumetambua tovuti %d ambazo bado zinasubiri uanzishaji wa leseni.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Ikiwa ungependa kutumia %s kwenye tovuti hizo, tafadhali weka ufunguo wako wa leseni hapa chini na ubofye kitufe cha kuwezesha.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Badala yake, unaweza kuiruka kwa sasa na kuwezesha leseni hiyo baadaye, katika ukurasa wa Akaunti ya kiwango cha mtandao wa %s yako.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Ukimaliza, zima %s kisha uiwashe tena.','Contact'=>'Wasiliana','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Tafadhali tujulishe iwapo ungependa tukutafute kwa ajili ya taarifa za usalama na vipengele, maudhui ya elimu, na matoleo ya mara chache:','Contact Support'=>'Wasiliana na Usaidizi','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Samahani kwa usumbufu na tuko hapa kusaidia ukitupa nafasi.','Contact Us'=>'Wasiliana Nasi','Please contact us here'=>'Tafadhali wasiliana nasi hapa','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Tafadhali wasiliana nasi kupitia ujumbe ufuatao:','Continue'=>'Endelea','Contributors'=>'Wachangiaji','Couldn\'t activate %s