zly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Tumia Tranzly na Page Builder Sandwich pamoja? Kifurushi hiki kinajumuisha programu-jalizi zote mbili za Pro kwa bei ya chini zaidi.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Leseni yako imeisha muda wake. Ipushe upya ili uendelee kupata masasisho na vipengele vya Pro.','Renew now'=>'Sasisha sasa','Compare the plans'=>'Linganisha mpango','Search features'=>'Tafuta vipengele','Area'=>'Eneo','Included in'=>'Imejumuishwa katika','No feature matches.'=>'Hakuna kipengele kinacholingana.','Features by plan'=>'Vipengele kwa mpango','Hide'=>'Ficha','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Iwezeshe kwenye skrini ya Programu-jalizi','Install it'=>'Iweka','Overview'=>'Muhtasari','Setup'=>'Sanidi','Plans and licence'=>'Mipango na leseni','Add-ons'=>'Add-ons','Get help'=>'Pata msaada','Feedback'=>'Maoni','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Chaguo lako halikuweza kuhifadhiwa.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'Hali ya kusanidi haikuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Match my computer'=>'Linganisha kompyuta yangu','Light'=>'Nyepesi','Dark'=>'Giza','Colour scheme'=>'Mpangilio wa rangi','Help'=>'Msaada','Guide to this screen'=>'Mwongozo wa skrini hii','Take the tour'=>'Fanya ziara','Get help or report a bug'=>'Pata msaada au ripoti mdudu','Plugin screens'=>'Skrini za programu-jalizi','That could not be saved.'=>'Haikikuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Before you contact support'=>'Kabla ya kuwasiliana na usaidizi','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'Ombi lako linatumwa kutoka kwenye tovuti hii kwenda kwa %s, ambao hutengeneza programu-jalizi hii. Tunatuma:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'anwani yako ya barua pepe na jina, ili tuweze kujibu;','the subject and message you write;'=>'mada na ujumbe unaoandika;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'kitambulisho chako cha leseni, ili wateja wanaolipa wapate kipaumbele;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'ikiwa tu utaiweka alama ya vema: maelezo ya tovuti (matoleo ya WordPress na PHP, mandhari, programu-jalizi, sehemu fupi ya kumbukumbu ya makosa huku nywila na anwani za barua pepe zikiwa zimeondolewa), ambayo unaweza kuyasoma kabla ya kuyatuma;','only if you add them: logins for your site, stored encrypted and deleted 30 days after your request is closed.'=>'ikiwa tu utaziongeza: maelezo ya kuingia kwenye tovuti yako, yaliyohifadhiwa kwa njia ya usimbaji fiche na kufutwa siku 30 baada ya ombi lako kufungwa.','Privacy policy'=>'Sera ya faragha','I agree, continue'=>'Nakubali, endelea','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Muunganisho haukuweza kuangaliwa.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Hilo halikufanya kazi. Jaribu tena.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn Digital® ulikata muunganisho wa tovuti hii.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn Digital® hautambui tena tovuti hii.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Umeondoa muunganisho wa tovuti hii.','Connect this site to support'=>'Unganisha tovuti hii kwa usaidizi','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Imeunganishwa. Majibu yanakwenda kwa %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Hujaunganishwa. Bado unaweza kutuma ombi ukitumia anwani yako ya barua pepe hapa chini; kuunganishwa kunaokoa muda wa kuiandika kila wakati.','E-mail address'=>'Anwani ya barua pepe','Your name (optional)'=>'Jina lako (si lazima)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Nakubali kuunganisha tovuti hii na usaidizi wa Zinn Digital®. Hatua hii inatuma anwani ya tovuti hii, matoleo ya WordPress na PHP na toleo la programu-jalizi, na inaweza kukatwa wakati wowote kutoka hapa au na Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Unganisha','I need help'=>'Ninahitaji msaada','Report a bug'=>'Ripoti hitilafu','Send feedback'=>'Tuma maoni','Request a feature'=>'Omba kipengele','The site details could not be read.'=>'Maelezo ya tovuti hayakuweza kusomwa.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ombi la yako halikuweza kutumwa. Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','WordPress admin'=>'Msimamizi wa WordPress','File manager'=>'Kidhibiti cha faili','cPanel'=>'cPanel','FTP / SFTP'=>'FTP / SFTP','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Maoni na maombi ya vipengele','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'Imetumwa. Rejeleo lako ni %s, na jibu letu litakuja kupitia barua pepe.','What is it about?'=>'Ni kuhusu nini?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Jibu kwa (barua pepe)','Subject'=>'Mada','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Ulifanya nini, ulitarajia nini, na nini kilitokea badala yake?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Jumuisha maelezo ya tovuti (matoleo, mandhari, programu-jalizi, dondoo la kumbukumbu ya hitilafu)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Ona hasa kinachotumwa','Loading…'=>'Inapakia…','Logins for support (optional, stored encrypted)'=>'Ingia kwa ajili ya usaidizi (si lazima, imehifadhiwa kwa njia ya usimbaji fiche)','A login is only sent with its password. Leave a row out rather than half-filled.'=>'Kuingia hutum moléculas na nenosiri lake pekee. Acha safu moja badala ya kuijaza nusu.','Login address'=>'Anwani ya kuingia','Username'=>'Jina la mtumiaji','Password'=>'Nenosiri','Add a login'=>'Ongeza kuingia kwenye mfumo','Create a temporary support login'=>'Undesha kuingia kwa muda kwa usaidizi','A separate user for our support team, without access to users, plugins installation or code editing. It is deleted automatically when it expires, or whenever you revoke it below.'=>'Mtumiaji tofauti kwa timu yetu ya usaidizi, bila ufikiaji wa watumiaji, usanikishaji wa programu jalizi au uhariri wa nambari ya simu. Inafutwa kiotomatiki muda wake ukiisha, au wakati wowote unapoifuta hapa chini.','Yes, for %d day'=>'Ndiyo, kwa siku %d' . "\0" . 'Ndiyo, kwa siku %d','Send'=>'Tuma','The list could not be loaded.'=>'Orodha haikuweza kupakiwa.','That login could not be removed.'=>'Kuingia huko kumeshindwa kuondolewa.','Temporary support logins'=>'Kuingia kwa usaidizi wa muda','None. Support can only log in to this site if you create a login here.'=>'Hakuna. Usaidizi unaweza kuingia kwenye tovuti hii tu ikiwa utatengeneza ukurasa wa kuingia hapa.','expired, being removed'=>'muda wake umekwisha, inaondolewa','expires %s'=>'inaisha muda %s','Revoke now'=>'Batilisha sasa','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Hatua ya %1$d kati ya %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Funga ziara','Back'=>'Rudi','Everything in one place'=>'Kila kitu mahali pamoja','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Tabu hizi zinaelekeza kwenye kila skrini ya programu-jalizi: usanidi, mipangilio, leseni yako, msaada na mengineyo.','Help on every screen'=>'Msaada kwenye kila skrini','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Fungua menyu hii kwa ajili ya mwongozo wa skrini uliyomo, ziara hii, au kumuomba msaada.','Light or dark'=>'Nuru au giza','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Chagua mandhari ya mwanga, giza, au sawa na kompyuta yako. Chaguo lako linakumbukwa kwa ajili yako pekee.','Welcome'=>'Karibu','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Ziara hii fupi inaonyesha vitu vilipo. Unaweza kuondoka wakati wowote kwa kubonyeza Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Tovuti yako kwa mtazamo mmoja','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Maendeleo ya usanidi na mpango wako vinaonyeshwa hapa, pamoja na jambo linalofuata linalofaa kufanywa.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Mpango wako, idadi ya tovuti inazojumuisha, na kama nakala hii ya tovuti inahesabiwa katika kikomo hicho.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Jaribu Pro au boresha','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Anza jaribio la bure bila kadi, boresha, au sasisha, yote kutoka hapa.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Kila kipengele na mpango unaojumuisha. Tafuta kipengele au uonyeshe eneo moja kwa wakati mmoja.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Zaidi kutoka Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Programu jalizi zinazofanya kazi na hii, na huduma kutoka kwa timu hiyo hiyo. Kadi ulizoficha kwenye skrini zingine zinaweza kuonyeshwa tena hapa.','Connect for faster help'=>'Unganisha kwa usaidizi wa haraka','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Kuunganisha si lazima. Inakuwezesha kutuma maombi bila kuandika barua pepe yako kila wakati, na unaweza kukata muunganisho wakati wowote upendao.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Omba msaada au ripoti mdudu','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Eleza kilichotokea. Unachagua kama ungependa kuambatisha maelezo ya tovuti, na unaweza kuona hasa kilichomo kwanza.','Temporary support access'=>'Upatikanaji wa usaidizi wa muda','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'Ikiwa usaidizi unahitaji kuangalia ndani ya tovuti yako, unda kuingia kwa muda hapa. Kujifuta kinapomalizika muda wake, na unaweza kukiondoa wakati wowote.','Tell us what to build'=>'Tuambie unachotaka kujenga','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Tuma wazo, ombi la kipengele au maoni yoyote. Yanaenda moja kwa moja kwa timu.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Hii inachukua dakika chache na inasanidi %s ili ifanye kazi kwenye tovuti hii mara moja. Unaweza kubadilisha kila kitu baadaye.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Uko tayari. Ikiwa chochote hakifanyi kazi kama ilivyotarajiwa, tuko mbali kwa mbofyo mmoja.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Hatua ya %1$d kati ya %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Maliza','Skip setup'=>'Ruka usanidi','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Imejengwa na Neil Lock, Mkurugenzi Mtendaji wa Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Toleo %s','Tranzly website'=>'Tovuti ya Tranzly','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Tovuti ya Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Tazama mipango ya Pro na bei zake','Languages'=>'Lugha','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Lugha ya kwanza ndiyo uliyotumia kuandikia maudhui yako. Wageni hubadilisha kwa kutumia kizuizi cha kubadilisha lugha.','(default)'=>'(chaguo-msingi)','Find a language'=>'Tafuta lugha','Type its name in your language or in its own, then choose it. The code and name below fill in by themselves.'=>'Chapa jina lake katika lugha yako au yake mwenyewe, kisha uchague. Nambari na jina vilivyo hapa chini hujaza vyenyewe.','Locale code'=>'Msimbo wa eneo','For example fr_FR'=>'Kwa mfano fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Jina (si lazima)','For example Français'=>'Kwa mfano Français','Add language'=>'Ongeza lugha','Front-end output'=>'Matokeo ya mbele','Class name prefix'=>'Kiapo cha jina la darasa','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kila jina la darasa ambalo programu-jalizi huchapisha kwenye kurasa zako huanza na kiambishi hiki, ili kurasa zisifichue ni programu-jalizi gani iliyozijenga. Herufi ndogo au nambari 1 hadi 8, zikianza na herufi.','Beta updates'=>'Sasisho za Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Tovuti hii inapokea matoleo ya majaribio kama masasisho.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Tovuti hii inapokea matoleo thabiti pekee.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Badilisha hii kwenye ukurasa wa Akaunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Matoleo ya Beta hutolewa kwa usakinishaji wa Pro wenye leseni ambao umeunganishwa na akaunti yao. Ukishaunganishwa, unaweza kujiunga kutoka kwenye ukurasa wa Akaunti.','Save settings'=>'Hifadhi mipangilio','First engine that is set up'=>'Injini ya kwanza iliyosanidiwa','Key saved. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'Ufunguo umehifadhiwa. Umehifadhiwa kwa njia ya usimbaji fiche na hautaonyeshwa tena kamwe.','Engine settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio ya injini imehifadhiwa.','Glossary saved.'=>'Glossari imehifadhiwa.','Your keys'=>'Funguo zako','Tranzly calls the translation services with your own account. Keys are stored encrypted in your database and are only ever sent to the service they belong to. AI model keys are set in the AI settings.'=>'Tranzly huita huduma za tafsiri kwa kutumia akaunti yako mwenyewe. Funguo huhifadhiwa zimesimbwa kwa njia fiche katika hifadhidata yako na hutumwa tu kwa huduma inayohusika. Funguo za mfano wa AI zimewekwa katika mipangilio ya AI.','%s API key'=>'Ufunguo wa API wa %s','Saved: %s. Enter a new key to replace it, or save an empty field to remove it.'=>'Imesohifadhiwa: %s. Weka ufunguo mpya ili kuubadilisha, au uhifadhi uwanja mtupu ili kuuondoa.','No key saved.'=>'Hakuna ufunguo uliyohifadhiwa.','Azure region (leave empty for a global resource)'=>'Kanda ya Azure (acha tupu kwa rasilimali ya kimataifa)','Save key'=>'Hifadhi ufunguo','Check my DeepL usage'=>'Angalia matumizi yangu ya DeepL','%1$s of %2$s characters used this billing period.'=>'Herufi %1$s kati ya %2$s zimetumika katika kipindi hiki cha malipo.','Which engine translates'=>'Injini ipi inayotafsiri','No engine is set up yet. Save a key above (or set up an AI model) to start translating.'=>'Hakuna injini iliyowekwa bado. Hifadhi ufunguo hapo juu (au weka mfano wa AI) ili kuanza kutafsiri.','Default engine'=>'Injini chaguomsingi','A different engine per language, automatic fallback and monthly spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Injini tofauti kwa kila lugha, ubadilishaji otomatiki na vikomo vya matumizi vya kila mwezi ni vipengele vya Tranzly Pro.','Engine for %s'=>'Injini ya %s','The default engine'=>'Injini chaguomsingi','If an engine fails or reaches a limit, try these next, in this order'=>'Injini ikishindwa au ikifikia kikomo, jaribu haya yanayofuata, kwa mpangilio huu','Monthly spending caps'=>'Vizuizi vya matumizi ya kila mwezi','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'Injini inapofikia kikomo chake, hakuna kingine kinachotumwa kwake hadi mwezi ujao na ripoti ya tafsiri iliyoshindwa inaeleza kwa nini. Acha wazi ili usiweke kikomo.','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s (imetumika mwezi huu: $%2$s)','Save caps'=>'Hifadhi herufi kubwa','Glossary and words never translated'=>'Kamusi na maneno ambayo hayatafsiriwa kamwe','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'Kamwe usitafsiri maneno haya (moja kwa kila mstari)','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'Majina ya chapa na bidhaa hubaki jinsi yalivyo, kwa kila injini.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Tafsiri zinazopendelewa na mtindo kwa kila lugha ni vipengele vya Tranzly Pro.','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'Tafsiri zinazopendekezwa (moja kwa kila mstari: neno = tafsiri)','Formality'=>'Udhamini Rasmi','Default'=>'Chaguo-msingi','Formal'=>'Rasmi','Informal'=>'Isiyo rasmi','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'Maagizo ya mtindo (hadhira, sauti ya chapa)','Save glossary'=>'Hifadhi kamusi','Settings'=>'Mipangilio','Translation engine'=>'Injini ya kutafsiri','What Tranzly translates on this site'=>'Kinachotafsiriwa na Tranzly kwenye tovuti hii','found, translated with your content'=>'zimepatikana, zimetafsiriwa na maudhui yako','not on this site'=>'siyo kwenye tovuti hii','With Tranzly Pro: Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen and WPBakery pages; everything in WooCommerce, with prices in the visitor’s currency; the SEO fields of Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress and All in One SEO; ACF, Meta Box and Pods fields; forms and their e-mails; your theme’s and plugins’ own text; and comments and reviews.'=>'Ukitumia Tranzly Pro: Kurasa za Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen na WPBakery; kila kitu kwenye WooCommerce, kukiwa na bei katika sarafu ya mgeni; sehemu za SEO za Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress na All in One SEO; sehemu za ACF, Meta Box na Pods; fomu na barua pepe zao; maandishi ya mandhari (theme) na programu-jalizi (plugins) zako; na maoni na uhakiki.','Shop text and e-mails'=>'Maandishi na barua pepe za duka','E-mail subjects and headings, payment and shipping method names, and the checkout notices. Each order’s e-mails go out in the language it was placed in.'=>'Mada na vichwa vya barua pepe, majina ya mbinu za malipo na usafirishaji, na ilani za malipo. Barua pepe za kila agizo hutumwa kwa lugha ambayo agizo liliwekwa.','Forms and their e-mails'=>'Fomu na barua pepe zao','Every form keeps one list of entries; its labels, buttons, messages and e-mails appear in the visitor’s language.'=>'Kila fomu huweka orodha moja ya maingizo; lebo, vitufe, jumbe na barua pepe zake huonekana katika lugha ya mgeni.','Saved.'=>'Imehifadhiwa.','No ACF, Meta Box or Pods fields are defined yet.'=>'Hakuna sehemu za ACF, Meta Box au Pods zilizofafanuliwa bado.','Field'=>'Sehemu','Where'=>'Ambapo','In a translation'=>'Katika tafsiri','What happens to %s in a translation'=>'Kinachotokea kwa %s katika tafsiri','Translate it'=>'Tafsiri','Copy it as it is'=>'Nakili jinsi ilivyo','Leave it empty'=>'Iache tupu','The shop’s currency'=>'Sarafu ya duka','Currencies'=>'Sarafu','Show prices in other currencies (the shop’s own is %s)'=>'Onyesha bei kwa sarafu zingine (%s ya duka lenyewe)','Exchange rates'=>'Viwango vya ubadilishaji','Rates last updated %s.'=>'Viwango vimesasishwa mwisho %s.','Rates have not been fetched yet.'=>'Viwango havijachukuliwa bado.','Update the rates now'=>'Sasisha viwango sasa','New currency'=>'Sarafu mpya','Choose…'=>'Chagua…','Rate (per 1 %s)'=>'Kiwango (kwa kila 1 %s)','Typing a rate keeps it: the daily update will not change it.'=>'Kuandika kiwango kutakihifadhi: sasisho la kila siku halitakibadilisha.','Rounding'=>'Kuzungusha','None'=>'Hakuna','Round up'=>'Ongeza idadi hadi namba kamili','Round to the nearest'=>'Kadirisha kwa karibu zaidi','Round down'=>'Punguza hadi namba kamili ya chini','Round to (for example 1, 0.05 or 10)'=>'Zungusha hadi (kwa mfano 1, 0.05 au 10)','Prices end in (for example 0.99)'=>'Bei zinaishia na (kwa mfano 0.99)','Add a currency'=>'Ongeza sarafu','Which visitors see which currency'=>'Ni wageni gani wanaoona sarafu gani','By country: two-letter country code (for example CH)'=>'Kwa nchi: msimbo wa nchi wa herufi mbili (kwa mfano CH)','Visitors from %s'=>'Wagenzi kutoka %s','Let visitors choose (shortcode [tranzly_currency_switcher])'=>'Wacha wageni wachague (shortcode [tranzly_currency_switcher])','Prices now depend on a cookie or on the visitor’s country: make sure your page cache varies by the "tranzly_currency" cookie, or excludes shop pages.'=>'Bei sasa zinategemea kuki au nchi ya mgeni: hakikisha akiba ya muda ya ukurasa wako inatofautiana kulingana na kuki ya "tranzly_currency", au haijumuishi kurasa za duka.','Save currencies'=>'Hifadhi sarafu','The words your theme and plugins print themselves (buttons, labels). Read a theme or plugin once, then translate its text here; your translation wins over the plugin’s own.'=>'Maneno ambayo mandhari na programu-jalizi zako huchapisha zenyewe (vifungo, lebo). Soma mandhari au programu-jalizi mara moja, kisha utafsiri maandishi yake hapa; tafsiri yako inashinda ya programu-jalizi yenyewe.','%d texts'=>'%d maandishi','not read yet'=>'bado haijasomwa','Read again'=>'Soma tena','Read its text'=>'Soma maandishi yake','Job started with %d translations to do. It runs in the background: you can close this page.'=>'Kazi imeanza ikiwa na tafsiri %d za kufanya. Inafanya kazi kwa nyuma: unaweza kufunga ukurasa huu.','Queued again.'=>'Imepangwa kwenye foleni tena.','Running'=>'Inafanya kazi','Finished'=>'Imekamilika','Set up a translation engine in the Engines tab first.'=>'Weka injini ya kutafsiri katika kichupo cha Injini kwanza.','Translate every'=>'Tafsiri kila kitu','Into'=>'Ndani ya','With'=>'Na','Each language’s own engine'=>'Injini ya kila lugha','Publish the translations (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Chapisha tafsiri (vinginevyo zinahifadhiwa kama rasimu)','Estimate the cost'=>'Kadiria gharama','%1$d posts, %2$s characters. The price for this engine is not known in advance.'=>'Machapisho %1$d, vibambo %2$s. Bei ya injini hii haijulikani mapema.','%1$d posts, %2$s characters: about $%3$s on your own account.'=>'Machapisho %1$d, herufi %2$s: takriban $%3$s kwenye akaunti yako mwenyewe.','Start translating'=>'Anza kutafsiri','Jobs'=>'Kazi','No translation jobs yet.'=>'Hakuna kazi za tafsiri bado.','Job %1$d — %2$s'=>'Kazi ya %1$d — %2$s','%1$d of %2$d translated, %3$d failed, %4$d skipped (protected or already in that language)'=>'%1$d kati ya %2$d imetafsiriwa, %3$d imeshindwa, %4$d imerukwa (imelindwa au iko tayari katika lugha hiyo)','Stop this job'=>'Simamisha kazi hii','See what failed and why'=>'Ona kilichoshindwa na kwa nini','Content'=>'Maudhui','Language'=>'Lugha','What went wrong'=>'Kilichokwenda vibaya','Fix it'=>'Rekebisha','Retry with'=>'Jaribu tena na','The same engine'=>'Injini ile ile','Retry'=>'Jaribu tena','Translate by hand'=>'Tafsiri kwa mkono','Menus saved.'=>'Menyu zimehifadhiwa.','%d texts translated.'=>'Maandishi %d yametafsiriwa.','Saved. Your corrections are protected from machine translation.'=>'Imehifadhiwa. Marekebisho yako yanalindwa dhidi ya tafsiri ya mtambo.','The same menu, translated'=>'Menyu ile hiyo, imetafsiriwa','A separate menu per language'=>'Menyu tofauti kwa kila lugha','By default each menu is translated: its links lead to the translated pages, with their titles. Choose a menu of its own for a language here instead.'=>'Kwa chaguo-msingi kila menyu hutafsiriwa: viungo vyake vinaelekeza kwenye kurasa zilizotafsiriwa, pamoja na vichwa vyao. Chagua menyu yake maalum kwa ajili ya lugha hapa badala yake.','Shared text'=>'Maandishi yaliyoshirikiwa','Which text'=>'Maandishi gani','Menu labels'=>'Lebo za menyu','Site title, tagline and widgets'=>'Kichwa cha tovuti, maelezo mafupi na wijeti','Templates, headers, footers and patterns'=>'Vigezo, vichwa vya habari, vijachini na ruwaza','Translate the missing text'=>'Tafsiri maandishi yanayokosekana','There is no text to translate here.'=>'Hakuna maandishi ya kutafsiri hapa.','Corrected by a person, protected'=>'Imerekebishwa na mtu, imelindwa','Save corrections'=>'Hifadhi masahihisho','Languages and settings'=>'Lugha na mipangilio','Engines'=>'Injini','Translation jobs'=>'Kazi za tafsiri','Addresses and SEO'=>'Anwani na SEO','Language switchers'=>'Vipata vya lugha','SEO audit'=>'Ukaguzi wa SEO','Menus and shared text'=>'Menyu na maandishi yaliyoshirikiwa','Translation status'=>'Hali ya tafsiri','Integrations'=>'Ushirikiano','No meta description'=>'Hakuna maelezo ya meta','A language version visitors cannot open (draft, private or password)'=>'Toleo la lugha ambalo wageni hawawezi kulifungua (rasimu, la faragha au lililo na nenosiri)','The address still uses the original words'=>'Anwani bado inatumia maneno ya asili','Still holds the original text'=>'Bado inashikilia maandishi ya asili','The multilingual SEO audit is part of Tranzly Pro. It finds missing meta descriptions, broken hreflang, untranslated addresses and duplicate content, per language.'=>'Ukaguzi wa SEO wa lugha nyingi ni sehemu ya Tranzly Pro. Unapata maelezo ya meta yaliyopotea, hreflang iliyovunjika, anwani ambazo hazijatafsiriwa na maudhui yanayofanana, kwa kila lugha.','Language to audit'=>'Lugha ya kukagua','Run the audit'=>'Endesha ukaguzi','Check the next pages'=>'Angalia kurasa zinazofuata','%1$d pages checked, %2$d problems found.'=>'Kurasa %1$d zimehakikiwa, matatizo %2$d yamegunduliwa.','The whole language has been checked.'=>'Lugha nzima imechunguzwa.','Page'=>'Ukurasa','Problem'=>'Tatizo','Edit'=>'Hariri','Job %1$d started: %2$d pages are being translated in the background. Follow it in Translation jobs.'=>'Kazi ya %1$d imeanza: kurasa %2$d zinatafsiriwa nyuma ya pazia. Ifuate katika Kazi za utafsiri.','%d translations are being checked in the background. Scores appear here as they arrive.'=>'Tafsiri %d zinakaguliwa kwa nyuma. Alama zinaonekana hapa kadri zinavyowasili.','Missing'=>'Haijakamilika','Out of date'=>'Haijasasishwa','Translated'=>'Imetafsiriwa','Edited by a person'=>'Imehaririwa na mtu','Machine translated'=>'Imetafsiriwa na mtambo','Waiting for review'=>'Inasubiri ukaguzi','Needs a human look'=>'Inahitaji ukaguzi wa binadamu','Everything'=>'Kila kitu','Up to date'=>'Imesasishwa','Tranzly is still working out which older translations are out of date. The "out of date" numbers will grow while it does.'=>'Tranzly bado inabaini ni tafsiri zipi za zamani ambazo zimepitwa na wakati. Hesabu za "zilizopapitwa na wakati" zitaongezeka wakati inafanya hivyo.','Content type'=>'Aina ya maudhui','All content'=>'Maudhui yote','Average quality'=>'Wastani wa ubora','%1$d translated (%2$d%%)'=>'%1$d zimetafsiriwa (%2$d%%)','Show'=>'Onyesha','Translate everything missing'=>'Tafsiri yote inayokosekana','Update everything out of date'=>'Sasisha kila kitu ambacho kimepitwa na wakati','Check the quality with AI'=>'Angalia ubora ukitumia AI','Translate the low-scoring pages again'=>'Tafsiri kurasa zenye alama za chini tena','Nothing here.'=>'Hakuna kitu hapa.','Quality'=>'Ubora','by a person'=>'na mtu','waiting for review'=>'inasubiri ukaguzi','Side by side'=>'Kando na kando','Show more'=>'Onyesha zaidi','Bulk translate the whole site (Pro)'=>'Tafsiri tovuti nzima kwa mara moja (Pro)','With Tranzly Pro, choose content types and languages, see the estimate, and translate the whole site in one go.'=>'Ukiwa na Tranzly Pro, chagua aina za maudhui na lugha, ona makadirio, na utafsiri tovuti nzima kwa mpigo mmoja.','%d background jobs started, one per language. Follow them in Translation jobs.'=>'Kazi za nyuma %d zimeanza, moja kwa kila lugha. Zifuate katika Kazi za tafsiri.','Content types'=>'Aina za maudhui','What to translate'=>'Cha kutafsiri','Only what is missing'=>'Kilichobaki pekee','Only what is out of date'=>'Ni yale tu yaliyopitwa na wakati','Everything (pages edited by a person stay as they are)'=>'Kila kitu (kurasa zilizohaririwa na mtu zinabaki jinsi zilivyo)','Estimate'=>'Kadiria','%1$d pages, %2$s characters. This engine does not publish a price.'=>'Kurasa %1$d, herufi %2$s. Injini hii haichapishi bei.','%1$d pages, %2$s characters, about $%3$s.'=>'Kurasa %1$d, herufi %2$s, takriban $%3$s.','Find a text'=>'Tafuta maandishi','%d more: type in "Find a text" to narrow the list.'=>'%d zaidi: andika katika "Tafuta maandishi" ili kupunguza orodha.','A small button in a corner of every page, on any theme, with no set-up.'=>'Kitufe kidogo kwenye kona ya kila ukurasa, kwenye mada yoyote, bila kusanidi.','Off'=>'Imezimwa','Bottom corner, end side'=>'Pembe ya chini, upande wa mwisho','Bottom corner, start side'=>'Pembe ya chini, upande wa mwanzo','Top corner, end side'=>'Kona ya juu, upande wa mwisho','Top corner, start side'=>'Pembe ya juu, upande wa kuanzia','Switcher around the content'=>'Kibadilishaji karibu na maudhui','Add a switcher to every post and page'=>'Ongeza kifaa cha kubadilishia kwenye kila chapisho na ukurasa','Before the content'=>'Kabla ya maudhui','After the content'=>'Baada ya maudhui','Other ways to add a switcher'=>'Njia zingine za kuongeza kibadilishaji','Block editor and site editor: the “Language switcher” block, with five designs.'=>'Kihariri cha vizuizi na kihariri cha tovuti: kizuizi cha "Kibadilisha lugha", chenye miundo mitano.','Page Builder Sandwich: the “Language switcher” element.'=>'Page Builder Sandwich: kipengele cha "Language switcher".','Menus: Appearance → Menus → “Language switcher” box.'=>'Menyu: Muonekano → Menyu → Sanduku la “Kibadilisha lugha”.','Sidebars: the “Language switcher” widget.'=>'Sehemu za kando: wijeti ya “Kibadilishaji lugha”.','Anywhere else, the shortcode:'=>'Popote pengine, nambari fupi:','Elementor and Bricks: the “Language switcher” widget in each builder.'=>'Elementor na Bricks: Wijeti ya “Language switcher” katika kila kijenzi.','Elementor and Bricks widgets are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Wijeti za Elementor na Bricks ni sehemu ya Tranzly Pro.','Save'=>'Hifadhi','A folder per language: example.com/de/'=>'Folda moja kwa kila lugha: example.com/de/','A subdomain per language: de.example.com'=>'Kikoa kimoja kwa kila lugha: de.example.com','A separate domain per language: example.de'=>'Kikoa tofauti kwa kila lugha: example.de','A query parameter: example.com/?lang=de (older sites)'=>'Kigezo cha hoja: example.com/?lang=de (tovuti za zamani)','Category'=>'Kategoria','Tag'=>'Lebo','Product'=>'Bidhaa','Product category'=>'Kitengo cha bidhaa','Product tag'=>'Lebo ya bidhaa','Saved. Your language addresses have changed as shown below.'=>'Imesemohifadhiwa. Anwani zako za lugha zimebadilishwa kama inavyoonyeshwa hapa chini.','Language in the address'=>'Lugha katika anwani','How visitors and search engines reach each language'=>'Jinsi wageni na injini za utafutaji zinavyofikia kila lugha','Address word for %s'=>'Neno la anwani la %s','The default language has no word in its addresses.'=>'Lugha chaguo-msingi haina neno katika anwani zake.','Domain for %s (optional)'=>'Kikoa cha %s (si lazima)','Point the domain at this site first. A language with no domain uses a folder on your main domain.'=>'Elekeza kikoa kwenye tovuti hii kwanza. Lugha isiyo na kikoa hutumia folda kwenye kikoa chako kikuu.','Where each language lives now'=>'Mahali ambapo kila lugha inaishi sasa','Translated address words'=>'Maneno ya anwani yaliyotafsiriwa','Page and post addresses come from their translated titles. Here you translate the fixed words, so /de/kategorie/ replaces /de/category/.'=>'Anwani za kurasa na machapisho zinatokana na vichwa vyao vilivyotafsiriwa. Hapa unatafsiri maneno yaliyowekwa, kwa hiyo /de/kategorie/ inachukua nafasi ya /de/category/.','%1$s (now “%2$s”)'=>'%1$s (sasa "%2$s")','Search engines and visitors'=>'Injini za utafutaji na wageni','Offer visitors their own language with a small banner (never a redirect)'=>'Wape wageni lugha yao kupitia bendera ndogo (si wakati wote kuelekezwa kwingine)','Hide untranslated pages from search engines (noindex)'=>'Ficha kurasa ambazo hazijatafsiriwa kutoka kwa injini za utafutaji (noindex)','A translation that still holds the original text is kept out of search results until it is translated.'=>'Tafsiri ambayo bado ina maandishi asilia huwekwa nje ya matokeo ya utafutaji hadi itafsiriwe.','Part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Sehemu ya Tranzly Pro.','Tranzly adds hreflang links (with x-default), the page language and direction, and every language to your sitemap:'=>'Tranzly inaongeza viungo vya hreflang (vyenye x-default), lugha ya ukurasa na mwelekeo, na kila lugha kwenye ramani ya tovuti yako:','Working together with: %s.'=>'Inafanya kazi pamoja na: %s.','Each address word is 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens.'=>'Kila neno la anwani lina herufi ndogo 2 hadi 12, nambari au vistari.','Auto-translate on update, reviewer roles, XLIFF export for translators, switching from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress and the AI quality check come with Tranzly Pro.'=>'Tafsiri ya kiotomatiki wakati wa kusasisha, nafasi za wakaguzi, usafirishaji wa XLIFF kwa ajili ya watafsiri, kuhamia kutoka WPML, Polylang au TranslatePress na ukaguzi wa ubora wa AI zinapatikana na Tranzly Pro.','When an original changes'=>'Wakati ya asili inapobadilika','When a page is edited'=>'Wakati ukurasa umehaririwa','Mark its translations out of date'=>'Weka alama kwenye tafsiri zake kuwa zimepitwa na wakati','Translate its translations again in the background'=>'Tafsiri tafsiri zake tena nyuma ya pazia','Do nothing'=>'Usifanye chochote','A translation a person edited is never overwritten; it is marked out of date instead.'=>'Tafsiri iliyohaririwa na mtu haifutwi kamwe; badala yake inawekewa alama kuwa imepitwa na wakati.','Translate new pages into every language when they are published'=>'Tafsiri kurasa mpya katika kila lugha zitakapochapishwa','A second AI model reads each translation beside its original, scores it and names the mistakes. It uses your own AI key from the AI settings. Start a check from Translation status.'=>'Modeli ya pili ya AI inasoma kila tafsiri kando ya asili yake, inaikadiria na kutaja makosa. Inatumia ufunguo wako wa AI kutoka kwa mipangilio ya AI. Anzisha ukaguzi kutoka kwa Hali ya tafsiri.','AI provider'=>'Mtoa huduma wa AI','The AI settings’ general model'=>'Mfano wa jumla wa mipangilio ya AI','Recommended'=>'Inayopendekezwa','A page needs a human look below this score'=>'Ukurasa unahitaji mtazamo wa kibinadamu chini ya alama hii','Publish only translations a reviewer approved'=>'Chapisha tafsiri zilizoidhinishwa na mkaguzi pekee','Give people the Translator role (edits translations, never the originals, cannot publish) or the Translation reviewer role (also approves). Reviewers also find everything waiting in the Posts and Pages lists under “Pending”; publishing one there approves it.'=>'Wape watu jukumu la Mtafsiri (huhariri tafsiri, si asili kamwe, hawezi kuchapisha) au jukumu la Mhakiki wa tafsiri (pia huidhinisha). Wahakiki pia hupata kila kitu kinachosubiri katika orodha za Machapisho na Kurasa chini ya "Inasubiri"; kuchapisha moja huko kunaidhinisha.','Manage users'=>'Dhibiti watumiaji','Nothing is waiting for review.'=>'Hakuna kinachosubiri ukaguzi.','Note for the translator (optional)'=>'Ujumbe kwa mtafsiri (si lazima)','Read side by side'=>'Soma kando kwa kando','Approve'=>'Idhinisha','Ask for changes'=>'Omba mabadiliko','%d translations imported and protected from machine translation.'=>'%d tafsiri zimeingizwa na kulindwa dhidi ya utafsiri wa mtambo.','Export and import for translators'=>'Hamisha na ulete kwa ajili ya watafsiri','Not translated yet'=>'Haijatafsiriwa bado','Already translated'=>'Imetafsiriwa tayari','Format'=>'Muundo','XLIFF 1.2 (translation tools)'=>'XLIFF 1.2 (zana za tafsiri)','CSV (spreadsheets)'=>'CSV (lahajedwali)','Download the file'=>'Pakua faili','Import a translated file'=>'Agiza faili lililotafsiriwa','Undone: %1$d links removed, %2$d imported pages deleted.'=>'Imetenduliwa: viungo %1$d vimeondolewa, kurasa %2$d zilizoingizwa zimefutwa.','Dry run, nothing changed:'=>'Jaribio la kukimbia, hakuna kilichobadilika:','Imported:'=>'Imeingizwa:','%1$d languages added, %2$d translations linked, %3$d pages built, %4$d texts.'=>'Lugha %1$d zimeongezwa, tafsiri %2$d zimeunganishwa, kurasa %3$d zimejengwa, maandishi %4$d.','Switch the other plugin off first (its addresses and switchers would fight Tranzly). Its data stays where it is, so you can switch back; Undo removes exactly what the import added.'=>'Zima programu nyingine ya ziada kwanza (anuani na vizibadilishi vyake vitakinzana na Tranzly). Data yake inabakia ilipo, kwa hivyo unaweza kurudi; Tendua huondoa hasa kile kilichoongezwa na uingizaji data.','No data from this plugin on this site.'=>'Hakuna data kutoka kwa programu-jalizi hii kwenye tovuti hii.','Languages: %s'=>'Lugha: %s','still active: switch it off first.'=>'bado inatumika: izime kwanza.','Dry run'=>'Jaribio la kavu','Import'=>'Leta','Undo the import'=>'Tendua uingizaji','Comments and product reviews'=>'Maoni na hakiki za bidhaa','Each language keeps its own'=>'Kila lugha hutunza yake','Show every language’s comments on every version'=>'Onyesha maoni ya kila lugha kwa kila toleo','Show them all, translated into the reader’s language'=>'Onyesha zote, zimetafsiriwa kwa lugha ya msomaji','Translating uses your translation engine for every approved comment. Spam and comments waiting for moderation are never sent.'=>'Tafsiri inatumia injini yako ya tafsiri kwa kila maoni yaliyoidhinishwa. Taka (spam) na maoni yanayosubiri udhibiti hayatumwi kamwe.','Saved. The pieces you changed are marked as checked by a person, and this translation is protected from machine translation.'=>'Imehifadhiwa. Vipande ulivyobadilisha vimetiwa alama kuwa vimekaguliwa na mtu, na tafsiri hii imelindwa dhidi ya tafsiri ya mtandao.','The layout of this translation was changed in the editor, so some pieces no longer pair with the original. Pieces without a partner are shown empty; edit the rest in the editor.'=>'Mpangilio wa tafsiri hii ulibadilishwa kwenye kihariri, kwa hivyo baadhi ya vipande haviendani tena na asili. Vipande visivyo na mwenzi vinaonyeshwa vikiwa vitupu; hariri vilivyobaki kwenye kihariri.','Open the editor'=>'Fungua kihariri','Original (%s)'=>'Asili (%s)','Translation (%s)'=>'Tafsiri (%s)','Save changes'=>'Hifadhi mabadiliko','Open in the editor'=>'Fungua katika kihariri','Checked by a person'=>'Imethibitishwa na mtu','Imported'=>'Imeingizwa','Not in the translation'=>'Haiko kwenye tafsiri','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ongeza lugha ya pili chini ya Tranzly katika menyu ya msimamizi, na kiteuzi kitaonekana hapa.','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Imezimwa kwa chaguo-msingi: bendera ni nchi, sio lugha.','What screen readers announce, for example “Choose a language”.'=>'Kile wasomaji wa skrini wanavyotangaza, kwa mfano "Chagua lugha".','Colours'=>'Rangi','Not translated'=>'Haijatafsiriwa','Original'=>'Ya asili','Published'=>'Imechapishwa','Draft'=>'Rasimu','Checked by a person, protected'=>'Imethibitishwa na mtu, imelindwa','Imported, protected'=>'Imetumizwa, inalindwa','Not translated yet (a copy)'=>'Haijatafsiriwa bado (nakala)','Save this post first, then translate it here.'=>'Hifadhi chapisho hili kwanza, kisha utafsiri hapa.','View'=>'Tazama','Unlock so it can be translated again'=>'Fungua ili iweze kutafsiriwa tena','Protect'=>'Kinga','Publish the translations'=>'Chapisha tafsiri','Translate into %d language'=>'Tafsiri katika lugha %d' . "\0" . 'Tafsiri katika lugha %d','Show this block'=>'Onyesha kizuizi hiki','In every language'=>'Katika kila lugha','Only in the languages ticked'=>'Katika lugha zilizotiwa alama pekee','In every language except those ticked'=>'Katika kila lugha isipokuwa zile zilizowekewa alama ya vema','Image per language'=>'Picha kwa kila lugha','Show another image to readers of a language, for example a banner with words on it.'=>'Onyesha picha nyingine kwa wasomaji wa lugha fulani, kwa mfano bendera yenye maneno juu yake.','Replace the %s image'=>'Badilisha picha ya %s','Choose a %s image'=>'Chagua picha ya %s','Use the original image'=>'Tumia picha asili','Correct this translation'=>'Sahihisha tafsiri hii','Saving…'=>'Inahifadhi…','Translated text. Press Enter to correct it.'=>'Maandishi yaliyotafsiriwa. Bonyeza Enter ili kuyasahihisha.','Click any outlined text to correct its translation.'=>'Bofya maandishi yoyote yaliyo na muhtasari ili kusahihisha tafsiri yake.','No translated text was found on this page to edit here. Use the side-by-side editor instead.'=>'Hakuna maandishi yaliyotafsiriwa yaliyopatikana kwenye ukurasa huu ya kuhaririwa hapa. Badala yake, tumia kihariri cha upande kwa upande.','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Kibadilishaji cha lugha','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Viungo vya ukurasa huu katika kila lugha ya tovuti. Haionyeshi chochote hadi lugha mbili au zaidi ziorodheshwe.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Lugha','block keywordswitcher'=>'kichochezi','block keywordtranslation'=>'tafsiri','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another of your languages: a list, pills, buttons, a dropdown or language codes, with optional flags.'=>'Inaruhusu wageni kusoma ukurasa huu kwa lugha yako nyingine: orodha, vitufe vya vidonge, vitufe vya kawaida, menyu ya kuteremka au misimbo ya lugha, ikiwa na bendera za hiari.','block keywordmultilingual'=>'yenye lugha nyingi']];